<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Central Bank lowers inflation forecasts.</title>
<headline>Swedish Central Bank lowers inflation forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, said on Thursday it saw inflation remaining low and cut its forecast for the Consumer Price Index to 0.5 percent this year and somewhat below two percent in 1998.</p>
</text>
